{"diagnosis": "SLTIU result x3/store datao is 0x00000000 vs expected 0x00000001 for 5000 < -1 immediate. Excerpt line 531 defines U2REGX as XMCC ? UIMM : U2REG, selecting zero-extended UIMM for the unsigned immediate path. With imm 0xFFF this yields 0x00000FFF (4095) instead of sign-extended SIMM 0xFFFFFFFF, so unsigned compare 5000 < 4095 is false.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/rtl/darkriscv.v b/rtl/darkriscv.v
--- a/rtl/darkriscv.v
+++ b/rtl/darkriscv.v
@@ -530,2 +530,2 @@
     wire signed [31:0] S2REGX = XMCC ? SIMM : S2REG;
-    wire        [31:0] U2REGX = XMCC ? UIMM : U2REG;
+    wire        [31:0] U2REGX = XMCC ? SIMM : U2REG;
", "expected": "tohost: PASS 0x1 with store daddr=00000000 datao=00000001 (x3=1 for 5000 < 0xFFFFFFFF)"}

